HTTP/1.1 408 Request Timeout
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8
Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
Connection: close

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">
<head>
<title>Request Timeout | Error 408</title>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
<style>
  body { margin:0; padding:0; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; color:#404040; background:#f7f7f8; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; }
  .cf-container { max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; padding:40px 24px 60px; }
  .cf-header { border-bottom:1px solid #dedede; padding-bottom:24px; margin-bottom:36px; }
  .cf-error-title { font-size:32px; font-weight:400; color:#222; margin:0 0 6px 0; }
  .cf-error-code { font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#999; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .cf-columns { display:flex; gap:48px; margin-bottom:40px; }
  .cf-column { flex:1; }
  .cf-column h2 { font-size:20px; font-weight:500; color:#222; margin:0 0 14px 0; }
  .cf-column p { margin:0 0 16px 0; color:#555; font-size:14.5px; }
  .cf-footer { border-top:1px solid #dedede; padding-top:24px; margin-top:40px; font-size:13px; color:#888; }
  .cf-ray-id { font-family:monospace; color:#222; background:#eaeaea; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:3px; }
  .cf-btn { display:inline-block; padding:9px 18px; font-size:13.5px; color:#fff; background:#0051c3; border:none; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; }
  @media(max-width:768px){ .cf-columns { flex-direction:column; gap:28px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cf-container">
  <div class="cf-header">
    <div class="cf-error-code">Error 408</div>
    <h1 class="cf-error-title">Request Timeout</h1>
    <div style="color:#666;font-size:14px;">The server timed out waiting for the request.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="cf-columns">
    <div class="cf-column">
      <h2>What happened?</h2>
      <p>The client did not produce a request within the time that the server was prepared to wait.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cf-column">
      <h2>What can I do?</h2>
      <p>Please check your network connection and try submitting the request again.</p>
      <button class="cf-btn" onclick="location.reload()">Try Again</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cf-footer">
    Performance &amp; security by Cloud Network &bull; Ray ID: <span class="cf-ray-id" id="ray-id">8f408a12b3c4d5</span>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  try {
    var hash = Array.prototype.map.call(new Uint8Array(8), function(x){return ('00'+((Math.random()*256)|0).toString(16)).slice(-2)}).join('');
    document.getElementById('ray-id').textContent = '8f' + hash;
  } catch(e){}
</script>
</body>
</html>
